welcome.description:
We're the {team} at {company}. You recently cancelled or downgraded {product}, and knowing why is the most useful thing you can tell us. Your reasons decide what we fix first.
• Takes about 4 minutes
• Only the {team} sees your answers; we never share them outside {company}
• Voluntary: you can stop at any time
• Open until {date}. Questions? {contact}
